<Layout title="About Tarian Ventures" description="Tarian Ventures is an independent venture development company based in Wales.">
  <PageIntro label="About us" title="About Tarian Ventures"><p>Tarian Ventures is an independent venture development company based in Wales.</p><p>We investigate, validate and develop opportunities across technology, infrastructure and complex regulated markets.</p><p>Our approach combines commercial analysis, technology development, governance and risk disciplines with rapid experimentation.</p></PageIntro>
  <section class="section tint-section"><div class="shell split"><div><img class="about-shield" src="/brand/logos/tarian-mark-green.svg" alt="" width="100" height="100" /><h2>Built in Wales.<br />Looking outward.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Tarian takes its name from the Welsh word for shield.</p><p>Our roots are in Wales, but our ambitions and the markets we investigate extend well beyond it.</p><p>We are particularly interested in opportunities where technology intersects with infrastructure, resilience and significant market change.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section shell split"><h2>Founder</h2><div class="prose"><p class="lead">Tarian Ventures was founded by <strong>Dan Winder</strong>, a technology and risk leader with experience spanning technology delivery, governance, data, digital risk and enterprise transformation.</p><p>His career has included work across telecommunications, government services and regulated consumer businesses, alongside the development of independent technology ventures.</p><p>Tarian Ventures brings those disciplines together: understanding complex problems, testing assumptions and building practical solutions.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
